  "solution": "1. × and =\n\n__**8 × 5**__ - 31 + __**12 ÷ 2**__ = 15\n\n⇒ __**40**__ - 31 __**+ 6**__ = 15\n\n⇒ 46 - 31 = 15\n\n⇒ 15 = 15\n\n2. - and +\n\n8 = 5 + 31 - __**12 ÷ 2**__ × 15\n\n⇒ 8 = 5 + 31 - __**6 × 15**__\n\n⇒ 8 = __**5 + 31**__ - 90\n\n⇒ 8 = __**36 - 90**__\n\n⇒ 8 ≠ -54\n\n3. + and ÷ \n\n8 = 5 - __**31 ÷ 12**__ + __**2 × 15**__\n\n⇒ 8 = __**5**__ - 2.58 __**+ 30**__\n\n⇒ 8 = __**35 - 2.58**__\n\n⇒ 8 ≠ 32.42\n\n4. ÷ and -\n\n8 = __**5 ÷ 31**__ + 12 - __**2 × 15**__\n\n⇒ 8 = __**0.16 + 12**__ - 30\n\n⇒ 8 = __**12.16 - 30**__\n\n⇒ 8 ≠ 17.84\n\nHence, '**× and =**' is the correct answer.",
